(7414174, 1169336, 123833, '<td valign="top">Le Radeau de la Méduse - looks like you all had fun! :)<br/>Great work as always</td>', 'Le Radeau de la Méduse - looks like you all had fun! :)Great work as always', '2015-11-04 09:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414177, 1169336, 86447, '<td valign="top">I thought this challenge topic might lure you out from wherever you''ve been hiding lately, Christophe! <br/> <br/>This is excellent.  As usual. <br/> <br/>Welcome back.</td>', 'I thought this challenge topic might lure you out from wherever you''ve been hiding lately, Christophe!  This is excellent.  As usual.  Welcome back.', '2015-11-04 10:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414208, 1169345, 112739, '<td valign="top">Love it Alessandro!</td>', 'Love it Alessandro!', '2015-11-04 12:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414210, 1169333, 180599, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  I really like the bright colors.</td>', 'Nice job!  I really like the bright colors.', '2015-11-04 12:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414211, 1169312, 180599, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Interesting to look at.</td>', 'Well done.  Interesting to look at.', '2015-11-04 12:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414213, 1169180, 180599, '<td valign="top">Creepy!</td>', 'Creepy!', '2015-11-04 12:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414214, 1169330, 180599, '<td valign="top">Creepy!</td>', 'Creepy!', '2015-11-04 12:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414231, 1169177, 141319, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is "Halloween" for me. But I DO like your very different, almost graphic approach to this theme. Nice and different.</td>', 'Not sure if this is "Halloween" for me. But I DO like your very different, almost graphic approach to this theme. Nice and different.', '2015-11-04 14:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414233, 1168859, 141319, '<td valign="top">For me there is too much overexposed and the bi-colour BG is disturbing rather than enhancing the picture. That''s just my opinion of course.</td>', 'For me there is too much overexposed and the bi-colour BG is disturbing rather than enhancing the picture. That''s just my opinion of course.', '2015-11-04 14:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414234, 1169325, 141319, '<td valign="top">Nice entry for the theme. I like the sepia treatment.</td>', 'Nice entry for the theme. I like the sepia treatment.', '2015-11-04 14:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414235, 1169288, 141319, '<td valign="top">Fore me this is not gory/creepy enough. I am also not a big fan of so much noise. Sorry, just my opinion.</td>', 'Fore me this is not gory/creepy enough. I am also not a big fan of so much noise. Sorry, just my opinion.', '2015-11-04 14:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414237, 1169333, 141319, '<td valign="top">Very different, I always like "different" when I think it is still an interpretation of the theme, which in this case I think it is. I like this. Also the lines to bring out more detail in the skull is really well done (not sure if you drew those or if it was made with something like Rodilius. One of my negatives is the white in the flower/smoke. It keeps detracting the eye. Perhaps it would have been better to "color" that part.</td>', 'Very different, I always like "different" when I think it is still an interpretation of the theme, which in this case I think it is. I like this. Also the lines to bring out more detail in the skull is really well done (not sure if you drew those or if it was made with something like Rodilius. One of my negatives is the white in the flower/smoke. It keeps detracting the eye. Perhaps it would have been better to "color" that part.', '2015-11-04 14:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414240, 1168997, 141319, '<td valign="top">:-) Nice work on your distortion. I feel perhaps a little sloppy on the hair. Love the eyes.</td>', ':-) Nice work on your distortion. I feel perhaps a little sloppy on the hair. Love the eyes.', '2015-11-04 14:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414242, 1169076, 141319, '<td valign="top">Clever. My only problem is that the reflections in the eyes are too small for me to see the detail. Pity, because I am sure there is meaning in that.</td>', 'Clever. My only problem is that the reflections in the eyes are too small for me to see the detail. Pity, because I am sure there is meaning in that.', '2015-11-04 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414244, 1169329, 141319, '<td valign="top">I like it, especially the "devil dog" ;-). Like the "movement" you generated with the multiple exposure - good idea.</td>', 'I like it, especially the "devil dog" ;-). Like the "movement" you generated with the multiple exposure - good idea.', '2015-11-04 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414245, 1169344, 141319, '<td valign="top">Very good idea and execution. I like it. Perhaps you could have given the pumpkin in the foreground a "base" to be on.</td>', 'Very good idea and execution. I like it. Perhaps you could have given the pumpkin in the foreground a "base" to be on.', '2015-11-04 14:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414246, 1169322, 141319, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I just feel from a photographic point of view there are a few problems. The teeth are overexposed and the hair seems very out of focus and also just "stuck on somehow. I know its supposed to be a Picasso painting, but for me the pieces down''t gel to a unified hole. But I like the idea.</td>', 'Nice idea. I just feel from a photographic point of view there are a few problems. The teeth are overexposed and the hair seems very out of focus and also just "stuck on somehow. I know its supposed to be a Picasso painting, but for me the pieces down''t gel to a unified hole. But I like the idea.', '2015-11-04 14:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414247, 1169134, 141319, '<td valign="top">If you don''t like expert editing, then I think you did a great job finding something creepy enough to photograph for this challenge. But just painting some glowing eyes for example, would have made this picture already more "Expert" and perhaps would have given you higher scores - don''t know how other voters weigh the editing rule in a challenge.</td>', 'If you don''t like expert editing, then I think you did a great job finding something creepy enough to photograph for this challenge. But just painting some glowing eyes for example, would have made this picture already more "Expert" and perhaps would have given you higher scores - don''t know how other voters weigh the editing rule in a challenge.', '2015-11-04 14:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
