(7415609, 1169336, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tvsometime:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats as usual. Just wondering how much time was spent on this project. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks a lot. Regarding the time involved:<br/>- A first shooting session at work took about 2h<br/>- Then I had to drive to the sea to shoot some waves, took about 5h<br/>- I had to pose for various characters and shoot various items, took about 3h<br/>- We had to create the raft and shoot it, about 2h<br/>- Processing, about 1h per character (18 of them), 3 hours on the sea, 2 hours of general editing<br/>Total = about 35 hours of work, and 62 original photos to upload (1.33Gb, sigh).</td>', 'Originally posted by tvsometime: Congrats as usual. Just wondering how much time was spent on this project.   Thanks a lot. Regarding the time involved:- A first shooting session at work took about 2h- Then I had to drive to the sea to shoot some waves, took about 5h- I had to pose for various characters and shoot various items, took about 3h- We had to create the raft and shoot it, about 2h- Processing, about 1h per character (18 of them), 3 hours on the sea, 2 hours of general editingTotal = about 35 hours of work, and 62 original photos to upload (1.33Gb, sigh).', '2015-11-11 09:59:05.000000', NULL, 0),
