(7415797, 1169336, 11078, '<td valign="top">Hi Christopher <br/>Excellent work and amazing ideas but I do have to ask you do you have a life outside DPC?you put so much work into a single image <br/>What do you do with these images do you keep them all or just move on to the next project - have you a book or display them in some way  <br/>How many images did you take to produce this you say you uploaded 62 original images but how many did you <u><b>actually take</b></u> <br/>It is great that you can visualise and create you also have many people to pose for you and no doubt excellent photographic equipment<br/>But you are such a genius when it comes to editing I love the sea in this What more can I say <br/>Sally</td>', 'Hi Christopher Excellent work and amazing ideas but I do have to ask you do you have a life outside DPC?you put so much work into a single image What do you do with these images do you keep them all or just move on to the next project - have you a book or display them in some way  How many images did you take to produce this you say you uploaded 62 original images but how many did you actually take It is great that you can visualise and create you also have many people to pose for you and no doubt excellent photographic equipmentBut you are such a genius when it comes to editing I love the sea in this What more can I say Sally', '2015-11-11 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
