(7416167, 1169076, 29326, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting image. I love to see the bars in a contrasting color (silver) instead of the same tones as the rest of the image :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I used old rusty nails for the bars.  I should have cleaned them up a little more.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Interesting image. I love to see the bars in a contrasting color (silver) instead of the same tones as the rest of the image :)  I used old rusty nails for the bars.  I should have cleaned them up a little more.', '2015-11-14 09:40:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7416263, 1169336, 34659, '<td valign="top">How you manage to recreate images in a fresh new perspective and create new ones on your own is not only a talent, but a gift.  You never cease to amaze me.  Thank you for sharing your gift with the world.  I (among many) am grateful for your ability and generous nature.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-11-15 10:33:17.</i></td>', 'How you manage to recreate images in a fresh new perspective and create new ones on your own is not only a talent, but a gift.  You never cease to amaze me.  Thank you for sharing your gift with the world.  I (among many) am grateful for your ability and generous nature.', '2015-11-15 10:32:24.000000', '2015-11-15 10:33:17.000000', 0),
